<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy — DevBox Tools</title>
  <meta name="description" content="DevBox Tools privacy policy. Learn how we protect your data with client-side processing and no tracking.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/devbox-tools/privacy-policy/">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="../assets/img/favicon.ico?v=1">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="../assets/img/favicon-32x32.png?v=1">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="../assets/img/apple-touch-icon.png?v=1">
  <link rel="manifest" href="../manifest.webmanifest">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/devbox-tools/privacy-policy/">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Privacy Policy — DevBox Tools">
  <meta property="og:description" content="DevBox Tools privacy policy. No data leaves your device.">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/devbox-tools/assets/img/og-cover.png">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a href="../" class="logo">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 192 192" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect width="192" height="192" rx="96" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
          <path d="M58 56L88 88L58 120" stroke="white" stroke-width="14" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
          <path d="M134 56L104 88L134 120" stroke="white" stroke-width="14" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
        </svg>
        DevBox
      </a>
      <nav>
        <ul class="nav-links">
          <li><a href="../">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="../guides/">Guides</a></li>
          <li><a href="../developers/">Developers</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <div class="header-actions">
        <button class="theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle theme">🌙</button>
        <button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Menu">☰</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
      <h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:24px;">Last updated: August 10, 2026</p>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px;">
        DevBox Tools ("we", "our", or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information when you use our tools.
      </p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">1. No Data Collection</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px;">
        We do not collect, store, or transmit any personal data. All tools run entirely in your browser using client-side JavaScript. Any data you enter into our tools is processed locally on your device and is never sent to our servers or any third party.
      </p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">2. No Cookies or Tracking</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px;">
        We do not use cookies, web beacons, or any tracking technologies. We do not use analytics services like Google Analytics. The only data stored locally is your theme preference (dark/light mode) in your browser's localStorage.
      </p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">3. Web Crypto API</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px;">
        For cryptographic operations (hashing, password generation, UUID generation), we use the browser's native Web Crypto API. These operations are performed locally and do not involve any external service.
      </p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">4. External Resources</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px;">
        Our site may load fonts and images from CDNs. These are not required for tool functionality and can be blocked without affecting core features. No data is shared with these CDNs beyond standard HTTP headers.
      </p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">5. GDPR & CCPA Compliance</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px;">
        Since we do not collect personal data, GDPR and CCPA requirements do not apply in the traditional sense. If you have any questions about your privacy when using DevBox Tools, please contact us at privacy@devbox.tools.
      </p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px;">
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="network-links">
      <p>Part of WebTools Network:</p>
      <a href="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/linkqr-tools/">LinkQR Tools — QR & Links</a>
      <a href="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/shiftfile-tools/">ShiftFile Tools — File Conversion</a>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="../assets/js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
